Cindy wailed as her boys were taken to the waiting hearse. Press photographers captured pictures of her clutching Robert supportively, whose face was also contorted with grief as they walked outside into the spring sunshine. Meanwhile, the homicides squad continued their investigation. They spoke to the owner of the property where the dam was located. He said that over the past eight years, seven vehicles had crashed through his fence from the highway. Robert Farquasen's was the only one that had ended up in the dam.
当男孩们的遗体被抬上等候的灵车时，辛迪放声痛哭。新闻摄影记者拍下了她紧紧搂住罗伯特以示支持的照片，当他们走到外面沐浴在春日的阳光下时，罗伯特的脸上也因悲伤而扭曲。与此同时，凶杀案调查组仍在继续他们的调查。他们与水库所在物业的业主进行了交谈。他说，在过去的八年里，有七辆车从高速公路冲破他的栅栏。罗伯特·法夸尔森的车是唯一一辆最终冲进水库的车。

