00:46:55.000 --> 00:47:37.000
Acting Sergeant Glenn Urquhart of the Major Collision Investigation Unit carried out a series of tests. He used a 1990 Holden Commodore with a video camera set up inside to film the entire experiment. Tire prints left by Robert's car indicated he'd been travelling at a speed of around 60km per hour. Urquhart set off down the same stretch of highway, cruising along at 64km. When he took his hands off the wheel, it didn't veer right as Robert Farquasen's car had, but instead, began to drift to the left.
重大交通事故调查组的代理警长格伦·厄克特进行了一系列测试。他使用了一辆1990款霍顿海军准将汽车，车内架设了摄像机来拍摄整个实验过程。罗伯特车轮留下的轮胎印表明他的车速约为每小时60公里。厄克特开着车驶上同一段高速公路，以64公里的时速行驶。当他把手从方向盘上移开时，车并没有像罗伯特·法夸尔森的车那样向右偏驶，而是开始向左偏离。

71
