01:19:50.000 --> 01:20:31.000
He'd also been cruel towards her, calling her fat mama, grabbing at her body while she was cooking or cleaning and sulking when she wasn't in the mood for sex. By October 2004, Cindy had had enough. She'd never been in love with Robert, and she told him she wanted a divorce. After they separated, Robert stalked Cindy, driving past her house at all hours of the day. He became fixated with her new relationship and was furious at the thought of another man becoming a father figure to his sons.
他对她也很残酷，叫她胖妈妈，在她做饭或打扫卫生时对她动手动脚，当她没有性趣时就生闷气。到2004年10月，辛迪已经受够了。她从未爱过罗伯特，并告诉他她想离婚。分居后，罗伯特跟踪辛迪，一天到晚开车从她家门前驶过。他开始对她新的恋情产生执念，一想到另一个男人会成为他儿子的父亲形象就愤怒不已。

120
01:20:31.000 --> 01:21:16.000
Yet, he refused to look after the boys when Cindy needed a babysitter, including on one occasion when she had to go to hospital. He made menacing threats, saying things like, I've got contacts, don't underestimate me. On the night of September 1, four days before her sons died, Robert called Cindy at home. Throughout the conversation, Cindy noticed that he sounded very depressed. She was concerned enough that she mentioned it to Stephen's mother, who advised her to just watch out. But Cindy had never dreamed that her boys might be in danger.
然而，当辛迪需要临时保姆时，他却拒绝照顾男孩们，包括有一次她不得不去医院。他发出威胁，说一些“我有人脉，别低估我”之类的话。9月1日晚上，也就是她儿子们死前四天，罗伯特给家里的辛迪打电话。在整个谈话过程中，辛迪注意到他听起来非常沮丧。她感到很担忧，便把这事告诉了史蒂芬的母亲，对方劝她多加留意。但辛迪做梦也没有想到她的儿子们会有危险。

121
01:21:16.000 --> 01:21:53.000
She suspected that Robert was suicidal, not homicidal. Cindy continued to believe in Robert's innocence throughout his trial, though she was troubled by Greg's testimony. It didn't make sense that a close friend of Robert's would come forward with such a story if it wasn't true. When she heard Robert had won his appeal, Cindy didn't feel relieved at all. She began to realize that perhaps she'd been in denial about her ex-husband's role in their son's deaths.
她怀疑罗伯特有自杀倾向，而不是有谋杀倾向。在审判期间，辛迪仍然相信罗伯特的清白，尽管格雷格的证词让她感到不安。罗伯特的亲密朋友如果不是真的发生过这种事，是不太可能编造出这样的故事的。当她听说罗伯特上诉成功时，辛迪一点也没有感到放松。她开始意识到，也许她一直在否认前夫在他们儿子死亡中所扮演的角色。

