01:28:40.000 --> 01:29:21.000
with her pain. In 2010, she married Stephen Miles. The couple have two children together. The murders of Jay, Tyler and Bailey Farquherson and the subsequent legal proceedings garnered nationwide attention and were widely covered by Australia's media. In 2013, crime journalist Megan Norris published a book about the case titled On Father's Day. Norris had previously written about a number of other cases in which men murdered their children during the course of marriage breakdown.
伴随着她的痛苦。2010年，她与史蒂芬·迈尔斯结婚。两人育有两子。杰伊、泰勒和巴里·法夸尔森的谋杀案以及随后的法律诉讼引起了全国范围的关注，并受到澳大利亚媒体的广泛报道。2013年，犯罪记者梅根·诺里斯出版了一本关于此案的书，名为《父亲节那天》。诺里斯此前曾撰写过其他几起案件，都是关于父亲在婚姻破裂期间谋杀自己孩子的。

